WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.800
River Bend Yoga was built for the moments when you need to put everything down:

00:05.800 --> 00:08.500
the busy week, the tired body,

00:08.500 --> 00:11.200
the mind that won't stop.

00:11.200 --> 00:15.800
Our classes are gentle enough for your first day,

00:15.800 --> 00:19.400
and meaningful enough to keep coming back.

00:19.400 --> 00:23.000
This is your studio. Come find your breath.